            <p>
<ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://mdsearchlight.com/cancer/multiple-endocrine-neoplasias-type-2-sipple-syndrome/?utm_source=pubmedlink&#x00026;utm_campaign=MDS&#x00026;utm_content=25357">Click here for a simplified version.</ext-link>
